  (text "J1001: pin 1 VIN_RAW, pin 2 GND, pin 3 TX, pin 4 RX (Nano D1/TX, D0/RX). GND is shared with the power input; pins 2-4 form a GND / TX / RX UART header. Do not plug a UART cable onto pins 1-2." (at 30 38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b65b6dc6-524d-4670-8959-1f086f6b53d8))
